# Pokemon Crystal, host: from the fixture save to the Cable Trade Center
# receptionist, where gen2_live_host.ap starts.  Its end state (linkplay
# stout) is the LIVE link fixture: the game is running, not booting.
# Fixture: the owner's Crystal save (host) and pksav.py's re-branded copy
# LINKB (guest), both standing in the Ecruteak dance theatre.
# Crystal: boot to the overworld from a save (title, CONTINUE, info box)
repeat 5
wait 120
press START
endrepeat
wait 200
hold A 8
wait 60
hold A 8
wait 120
evt booted
# Ecruteak dance theatre -> Pokemon Center 1F -> 2F -> the Cable Trade
# Center receptionist.  Walking is stepram (one tile per 48 frames, checked
# after it lands) or a hold into something solid: a player's buttons reach
# the game a session's input delay later, and a hold ended by a position
# check would overshoot by that delay.
hold DOWN 64
wait 60
stepram LEFT 1 0xDCB8 0xFF 21 1000
stepram DOWN 1 0xDCB7 0xFF 28 1000
stepram RIGHT 1 0xDCB8 0xFF 23 1000
stepram UP 1 0xDCB6 0xFF 3 1000
wait 120
# Pokemon Center 1F (7,3): stairs in the bottom-left corner
stepram UP 1 0xDCB7 0xFF 6 1000
stepram LEFT 1 0xDCB8 0xFF 0 1000
stepram DOWN 1 0xDCB5 0xFF 20 1000
wait 120
# 2F (7,0): the left receptionist, Cable Trade Center, at (5,2)
stepram UP 1 0xDCB7 0xFF 4 1000
stepram RIGHT 1 0xDCB8 0xFF 5 1000
stepram UP 1 0xDCB7 0xFF 3 1000
evt at_counter
wait 30
